            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Преобразуй массив <code>ghosts</code> в строку, чтобы создать JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ghosts = [{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Casper&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"color\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;white&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"scareFactor\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"color\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;transparent&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"scareFactor\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(ghosts));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"156\" /><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"157\" /><option startIndex=\"157\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"173\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parse\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[{&quo